attach the same EBS volume to multiple EC2
instance has full read& write permissions to the high-performance volume
up to 16 EC2 instance at a time
must be in the same AZ/Availability zone
file system must be cluster aware

EBS encryption types:
  1) data at rest
    1.1) snaphots are encrypted
    1.2) all volumes created from the snapshot
  2) data in transit
uses leverage keys from KMS that uses AES-256
